@startuml library-architecture
title Folder Assistant — Library Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Sans

package "Client surfaces" #DCE9F5 {
  [Console loop] as Console
  [HTTP API] as Http
}

package "Host libraries" #DCE9F5 {
  [Conversation orchestration] as Orchestration
  [Folder tools] as Tools
  [Indexing pipeline] as Pipeline
  [Retrieval] as Retrieval
}

package "Extension points" #F5E3CC {
  interface IVectorizer
  interface IVectorStoreWriter
  interface IVectorStoreReader
  interface IRetrievalQuery
}

package "Storage" #E2E2E2 {
  database "Folder database" as Db
}

package "External providers" #E6DAF2 {
  [Language model provider] as Llm
  [Embedding service (optional)] as EmbedSvc
}

Console --> Orchestration
Http --> Orchestration
Orchestration --> Tools
Orchestration --> Retrieval
Orchestration --> Llm

Pipeline --> IVectorizer
Pipeline --> IVectorStoreWriter
Retrieval --> IRetrievalQuery
Retrieval --> IVectorizer
IRetrievalQuery --> IVectorStoreReader

IVectorizer ..> EmbedSvc : only for service-backed\nimplementations
IVectorStoreWriter --> Db
IVectorStoreReader --> Db

note right of IVectorizer
  Reports its own dimension.
  A trained model's dimension is
  fixed by its weights, so
  configuration cannot choose it.
end note

note bottom of Db
  Vectors keyed
  (chunk_id, model_version_id),
  so two models coexist.
end note

@enduml
